# LIVITECT — MASTER AI ARCHITECT & FRONTEND PROMPT

## 1. Brand & Business Positioning
- **Brand Name:** LIVITECT (Plan. Design. Build. Finance.)
- **Positioning:** End-to-End Construction, Architecture, Building Materials & Project Financing Platform (Headquartered at 301, Dharmrath Palace, Kankarbagh, Patna, Bihar – 800020; operating across Bihar, Jharkhand, UP, MP, Uttarakhand).
- **UX Philosophy:** Booking.com-inspired Action-First Marketplace UX + Linear/Stripe minimal spacing + **Visual/Image-First Architecture**. Every service card, project card, process step, and material category MUST feature high-resolution architectural/construction imagery and interactive carousels so clients visually understand Livitect's work immediately.

## 2. Strict Color System (Tailwind Tokens)
- **Primary (`brand`):** `#924621` (Terracotta / Burnt Architectural Brown) -> Use ONLY for primary CTAs, active tabs, badges, icons, and key highlights. Do NOT flood backgrounds with this color.
- **Primary Dark (`brand-dark`):** `#6F3218` (Hover states, active button press)
- **Primary Light (`brand-light`):** `#F4E9E4` (Subtle badges, active card borders, icon containers)
- **Dark (`ink`):** `#1F1F1F` (Headings & primary text)
- **Dark Gray (`ink-muted`):** `#4B4B4B` (Subheadings & body text)
- **Gray (`ink-subtle`):** `#737373` (Captions, metadata, form labels)
- **Light Gray (`surface-muted`):** `#F5F5F5` / `#F7F7F7` (Alternating section backgrounds)
- **Border (`border-subtle`):** `#E5E5E5` (1px solid clean card borders)
- **Background (`surface`):** `#FFFFFF` (Main background & card surfaces)

## 3. Image-First & Carousel Design Rules (CRITICAL)
1. **No Plain Text Cards:** Every card (Services, Process Steps, Projects, Materials, Financing) MUST include a visual header or split image (`aspect-[16/10]` or `aspect-[4/3]`) using `next/image` with smooth hover zoom (`group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500`).
2. **Multi-Image Carousels Everywhere:**
   - **Hero Section:** Interactive split visual with swipeable carousel showing (a) 3D Modern Elevation, (b) 2D CAD Blueprint Overlay, (c) Live Turnkey Site Execution, (d) Luxury Interior Finish.
   - **Workings / Process Section:** Visual before-to-after step slider (Plot Survey -> 2D/3D Naksha -> Foundation/Structure -> Finishing & Handover).
   - **Project & Service Cards:** Horizontal swipeable carousels on mobile (`snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto`) and sleek multi-card grid/sliders on desktop.
3. **Responsive Ratios:** Mobile cards use full-width swipeable carousels (`w-[85vw] sm:w-[340px]`), Tablet uses 2-column grids, Desktop (`max-w-7xl`) uses 3 to 4-column Bento/Booking-style grids.

## 4. Complete 19-Section Homepage Architecture
1. Sticky Minimal Header (Logo, 6 Nav Links, Phone CTA, Get Started Button)
2. Hero Section + Visual Showcase Carousel (Left: Headline & CTA, Right: 4-stage Construction Visual Slider)
3. Booking.com-Style Quick Service Search Bar (Floating/overlapping action box with 8 visual service pills)
4. Core Services Grid (8 visual cards with real architectural/site photos + arrow links)
5. "One Platform. Every Step" (01 Plan -> 02 Estimate -> 03 Finance -> 04 Build -> 05 Finish — with visual stage cards)
6. "How Livitect Works On-Site" Visual Gallery (Blueprint vs Reality split slider & site inspection visuals)
7. Interactive Construction Cost Estimator (Property Type, City in Bihar, Sq.Ft, Quality + Visual Package Preview)
8. Detailed Service Deep-Dive Cards (Large Booking.com style horizontal/grid cards with multi-image previews)
9. Featured Projects Portfolio (Filterable by All/Residential/Commercial/Interior/Turnkey + Image Carousels per project)
10. 5-Step Execution Workflow (01 Requirement to 05 Handover with real site photos)
11. Building Materials Marketplace Section (Visual cards for Cement, TMT Steel, Bricks, Tiles, Electrical, Plumbing, Paint, Hardware)
12. Project Financing & Commercial Investor Connect (2 visual cards with careful legal wording: "Financing Assistance")
13. Trust & Why Livitect Section (6 visual trust badges + transparent metrics)
14. Interactive Office Locator (State dropdown for Bihar/MP/UK/UP/Jharkhand + Patna Kankarbagh HQ Card with Office Photo)
15. Client Callback / Project Discussion Form (Booking.com style clean form + instant WhatsApp/Telegram trigger)
16. AEO / Local SEO Direct Q&A Accordion (Structured FAQ for Patna/Bihar construction rates)
17. Minimal 4-Column Footer
18. Floating Quick Action Bar (WhatsApp, Call, Cost Calculator trigger)
19. Exit-Intent / Consultation Modal
